--Description:
-- We must cast the STRING event_date ('YYYYMMDD') into a DATE before any date math,
-- otherwise BigQuery raises “Invalid timestamp” errors.
-- Steps:
--   1. Convert event_date → DATE using PARSE_DATE('%Y%m%d', event_date).
